WEBVTT

00:13:29.236 --> 00:13:31.836
Long gone are the days
of the backstreet tattoo studio,

00:13:31.876 --> 00:13:35.396
tattooing is actually a pretty
upstanding career now.

00:13:35.436 --> 00:13:37.716
(Laughter)

00:13:38.236 --> 00:13:39.396
So there you go.

00:13:39.436 --> 00:13:42.076
The word tattoo is not a dirty word.

00:13:42.116 --> 00:13:43.876
It's a transformational word.

00:13:43.876 --> 00:13:45.636
It's a life-changing word.

00:13:46.036 --> 00:13:51.076
And when you give someone a tattoo
that truly makes them feel whole again,

00:13:51.116 --> 00:13:54.476
it gives them confidence
and a better quality of life,

00:13:54.476 --> 00:13:55.956
that, my friends,

00:13:55.956 --> 00:13:59.036
is how you use tattoos
as a tool for empowerment.